      "text": "@discoveredmat We also observe large amounts of reward hacking from the Claude models (Opus and Fable) during the run. In one instance, Fable submitted the same material 58 times - using larger and larger super-cells of the same material in an attempt to fool our grader. https://t.co/JORxVLeAvy",
