    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2086831389123784836",
      "url": "https://x.com/advaith_sridhar/status/2086831389123784836",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/advaith_sridhar/status/2086831389123784836",
      "text": "However, finding new materials is just the beginning. Figuring out how to make them in the lab is really hard, and is often the bottleneck in material discovery. On this front, all models struggle. Out of the 500+ new materials discovered by models, only 1 (discovered by Sol) has a plausible synthesis route.",
